{"3833280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Loulan: The Cursed Sand", "steam_appid": 3833280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Supported Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re still planning the localization for other languages, thank you all so much for your patience and excitement! ♥</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loulan: The Cursed Sand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loulan: The Cursed Sand is an action RPG set along the ancient Silk Road in the Western Regions of China. It tells a tragic love story of an exiled royal guard who returns to the fallen kingdom of Loulan amidst the chaos of war to find his beloved princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the skeletal warrior known as &quot;The Cursed Sand&quot;, mastering the power of sand to explore and solve puzzles in a perilous top-down world. Engage in realistic melee combat against overwhelming odds, defeat powerful enemies, and confront the fate of your own cursed existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Warrior of Dual Forms: </strong>Control the skeletal warrior &quot;The Cursed Sand&quot;, freely switching between bone and sand forms to experience entirely different combat styles and story interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/91ec38e7785055b6c320248cc6ab4f3a.poster.avif?t=1761878165\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/91ec38e7785055b6c320248cc6ab4f3a.webm?t=1761878165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Melee Combat Against Many: </strong>Engage in grounded, one-against-many melee battles from a dynamic top-down perspective, where terrain design, enemy composition, and combat mechanics intertwine to test your skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/4d5e8a6b8d39d04db75149c5f174cbfd.poster.avif?t=1761878165\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/4d5e8a6b8d39d04db75149c5f174cbfd.webm?t=1761878165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse and Creative Sand Abilities: </strong>Learn and wield unique sand abilities to solve puzzles, explore intricate levels, and experiment with multiple combat styles and tactical approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/f4312c9cb5755627c720f04e6bf75442.poster.avif?t=1761878165\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/f4312c9cb5755627c720f04e6bf75442.webm?t=1761878165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formidable Elites and Bosses: </strong>Face thrilling one-on-one encounters with powerful elite enemies and colossal bosses that challenge your mastery and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/ad13c1f404cbd3571d5e70e0a82294b0.poster.avif?t=1761878165\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/ad13c1f404cbd3571d5e70e0a82294b0.webm?t=1761878165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Western Fantasy World: </strong>Explore a mysterious world inspired by the lost Kingdom of Loulan along the Silk Road, featuring diverse regions and atmospheric, handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/2ccb59425e17367f508ec76b794a733c.poster.avif?t=1761878165\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/2ccb59425e17367f508ec76b794a733c.webm?t=1761878165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About Supported Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re still planning the localization for other languages, thank you all so much for your patience and excitement! ♥</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Loulan: The Cursed Sand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loulan: The Cursed Sand is an action RPG set along the ancient Silk Road in the Western Regions of China. It tells a tragic love story of an exiled royal guard who returns to the fallen kingdom of Loulan amidst the chaos of war to find his beloved princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the skeletal warrior known as &quot;The Cursed Sand&quot;, mastering the power of sand to explore and solve puzzles in a perilous top-down world. Engage in realistic melee combat against overwhelming odds, defeat powerful enemies, and confront the fate of your own cursed existence.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Warrior of Dual Forms: </strong>Control the skeletal warrior &quot;The Cursed Sand&quot;, freely switching between bone and sand forms to experience entirely different combat styles and story interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/91ec38e7785055b6c320248cc6ab4f3a.poster.avif?t=1761878165\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/91ec38e7785055b6c320248cc6ab4f3a.webm?t=1761878165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Melee Combat Against Many: </strong>Engage in grounded, one-against-many melee battles from a dynamic top-down perspective, where terrain design, enemy composition, and combat mechanics intertwine to test your skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/4d5e8a6b8d39d04db75149c5f174cbfd.poster.avif?t=1761878165\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/4d5e8a6b8d39d04db75149c5f174cbfd.webm?t=1761878165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse and Creative Sand Abilities: </strong>Learn and wield unique sand abilities to solve puzzles, explore intricate levels, and experiment with multiple combat styles and tactical approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/f4312c9cb5755627c720f04e6bf75442.poster.avif?t=1761878165\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/f4312c9cb5755627c720f04e6bf75442.webm?t=1761878165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Formidable Elites and Bosses: </strong>Face thrilling one-on-one encounters with powerful elite enemies and colossal bosses that challenge your mastery and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/ad13c1f404cbd3571d5e70e0a82294b0.poster.avif?t=1761878165\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/ad13c1f404cbd3571d5e70e0a82294b0.webm?t=1761878165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Western Fantasy World: </strong>Explore a mysterious world inspired by the lost Kingdom of Loulan along the Silk Road, featuring diverse regions and atmospheric, handcrafted levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833280/extras/2ccb59425e17367f508ec76b794a733c.poster.avif?t=1761878165\